.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"ClueLake\",\"applicationCategory\":\"DeveloperApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Kubernetes\",\"description\":\"ClueLake connects logs, metrics, traces and Kubernetes context so teams can move from production regressions to the changes that caused them.\",\"url\":\"https://cluelake.com\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Orkastor Ltd\"}}"}}]]}]}]]}],{"children":["pricing",["$","$1","c",{"children":[null,["$","$L3",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","pricing","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L5",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","forbidden":"$undefined","unauthorized":"$undefined"}]]}],{"children":["__PAGE__",["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","section",null,{"className":"grid-field border-b border-[color:var(--color-line)] py-14 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1160px] px-5 sm:px-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[color:var(--color-fg-subtle)]","children":"Pricing"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[24ch] text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.4rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.032em]","children":"Usage-based, and predictable before the invoice."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-[46rem] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-fg-muted)]","children":"You pay for what you send and keep. The controls that decide how much that is are part of the product rather than an afterthought."}]]}]}],["$","$L8",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-[color:var(--color-line)]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1160px] px-5 sm:px-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[46rem]","children":[null,["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-semibold tracki